<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In Training-Free Time Series Classification via In-Context Reasoning with LLM Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>LLMs’ Inference Configurations</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In Training-Free Time Series Classification via In-Context Reasoning with LLM Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Prompts of <span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">FETA</span></span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
<div class="ltx_page_main">
<div id="infobox" class="infobox">
